    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11934" root="دأل" body-key="d">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دُؤْلُولٌ</span></b>  <i>A calamity,</i> or <i>misfortune:</i> (S, M, O,
K:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَآلِيلُ</span>. (S.) And <i>Confusion.</i> (K.) You
say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَقَعَ القَوْمُ فِى دُؤْلُولٍ</span> <i>The people,</i> or <i>party,
fell into confusion in respect of their case</i> or
<i>affairs.</i> (S.)

